msgid "(failed to read)"
msgstr "（讀取失敗）"

msgid "(this section does not exist)"
msgstr "（該段不存在）"

msgid "1. Source file"
msgstr "1. 來源檔案"

msgid "2. Conversion parameters"
msgstr "2. 轉碼參數"

msgid "3. Run and download"
msgstr "3. 執行與下載"

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "Browse…"
msgstr "瀏覽…"

msgid "Conversion failed."
msgstr "轉碼失敗。"

msgid "Conversion finished."
msgstr "轉碼完成。"

msgid "Conversion started."
msgstr "轉碼已開始。"

msgid "Conversion stopped."
msgstr "轉碼已停止。"

msgid "Download result"
msgstr "下載結果"

msgid "Failed to save the conversion settings."
msgstr "儲存轉碼設定失敗。"

msgid "ffmpeg exited with code %s."
msgstr "ffmpeg 結束碼為 %s。"

msgid "ffmpeg produced no output."
msgstr "ffmpeg 沒有產生任何輸出。"

msgid "File conversion"
msgstr "檔案轉碼"

msgid "Idle"
msgstr "閒置"

msgid "No audio or video stream was detected."
msgstr "沒有偵測到音訊或視訊串流。"

msgid "No file has been uploaded yet."
msgstr "尚未上傳檔案。"

msgid "This device can decode this file, so re-encoding is available."
msgstr "本機可以解碼這個檔案，可以使用重新編碼。"

msgid "This device cannot decode this file. Only “Copy (no re-encode)” will work; any re-encode will fail."
msgstr "本機無法解碼這個檔案。只有「複製（不重新編碼）」可用，任何重新編碼都會失敗。"

msgid "Video"
msgstr "視訊"

msgid "Only encoders this device can actually use are listed. If H.264/H.265 are missing, this ffmpeg build cannot encode them."
msgstr "只列出本機實際可用的編碼器。如果沒有 H.264/H.265，表示這個 ffmpeg 編譯版本不支援它們。"

msgid "Output container"
msgstr "輸出容器"

msgid "Please upload a source file first."
msgstr "請先上傳來源檔案。"

msgid "Running…"
msgstr "執行中…"

msgid "Start conversion"
msgstr "開始轉碼"

msgid "Settings were not saved (the section is still empty)."
msgstr "設定未能儲存（設定段仍是空的）。"

msgid "Starting conversion…"
msgstr "正在開始轉碼…"

msgid "The conversion runs on the router. Keep this page open to follow the progress."
msgstr "轉碼在路由器上進行，保持本頁面開啟可查看進度。"

msgid "No file selected."
msgstr "尚未選擇檔案。"

msgid "Stopping…"
msgstr "正在停止…"

msgid "The file is uploaded into the router RAM disk and never written to flash."
msgstr "檔案會先上傳到路由器的記憶體磁碟，不會寫入快閃記憶體。"

msgid "Access to the upload path was denied by ACL."
msgstr "上傳目標路徑被 ACL 拒絕。"

msgid "FFV1 (lossless)"
msgstr "FFV1（無損）"

msgid "H.264 (hardware, v4l2m2m)"
msgstr "H.264（硬體編碼，v4l2m2m）"

msgid "H.265 (hardware, v4l2m2m)"
msgstr "H.265（硬體編碼，v4l2m2m）"

msgid "I/O failure while writing the file."
msgstr "寫入檔案時發生 I/O 錯誤。"

msgid "Internal program failure."
msgstr "程式內部錯誤。"

msgid "Upload failed."
msgstr "上傳失敗。"

msgid "Upload permission denied."
msgstr "沒有上傳權限。"

msgid "Upload"
msgstr "上傳"

msgid "Upload a file, convert it with FFmpeg on the router, then download the result. The settings below are stored as a normal task named \"convert\"."
msgstr "上傳檔案後用路由器上的 FFmpeg 轉碼，再下載結果。下面的設定會儲存成一個名為 \"convert\" 的一般任務。"

msgid "Uploaded"
msgstr "已上傳"

msgid "Uploading…"
msgstr "正在上傳…"

msgid "Add a task"
msgstr "新增任務"

msgid "Applying changes..."
msgstr "正在套用變更…"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "關閉"

msgid "FFmpeg Overview"
msgstr "FFmpeg 總覽"

msgid "Input"
msgstr "輸入"

msgid "Loading..."
msgstr "正在載入…"

msgid "Log"
msgstr "日誌"

msgid "No tasks have been configured yet."
msgstr "尚未設定任何任務。"

msgid "Operation completed."
msgstr "操作已完成。"

msgid "Operation failed."
msgstr "操作失敗。"

msgid "Output"
msgstr "輸出"

msgid "Please wait"
msgstr "請稍候"

msgid "Read-only access"
msgstr "唯讀權限"

msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重新啟動"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "執行中"

msgid "Running: %s / %s"
msgstr "執行中：%s / %s"

msgid "Runtime state of every configured FFmpeg task. The list refreshes automatically."
msgstr "所有已設定 FFmpeg 任務的執行狀態，清單會自動重新整理。"

msgid "Start"
msgstr "啟動"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "狀態"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "Task"
msgstr "任務"

msgid "Task log"
msgstr "任務日誌"

msgid "The log is empty."
msgstr "日誌是空的。"

msgid "Analyzing the file…"
msgstr "正在分析檔案…"

msgid "Audio"
msgstr "音訊"

msgid "Audio bitrate"
msgstr "音訊位元率"

msgid "Audio codec"
msgstr "音訊編碼"

msgid "Copy (no re-encode)"
msgstr "複製（不重新編碼）"

msgid "Debug"
msgstr "偵錯"

msgid "Disable audio"
msgstr "停用音訊"

msgid "Disable video"
msgstr "停用視訊"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "啟用"

msgid "Error"
msgstr "錯誤"

msgid "Every task is one ffmpeg process. Changing a task requires a restart of that task to take effect."
msgstr "每個任務對應一個 ffmpeg 程序。修改任務後需要重新啟動該任務才會生效。"

msgid "Extra arguments"
msgstr "額外參數"

msgid "FFmpeg Tasks"
msgstr "FFmpeg 任務"

msgid "Frame rate"
msgstr "畫面更新率"

msgid "Info"
msgstr "資訊"

msgid "Input source"
msgstr "輸入來源"

msgid "Log level"
msgstr "日誌等級"

msgid "My task"
msgstr "我的任務"

msgid "Output format"
msgstr "輸出格式"

msgid "Output target"
msgstr "輸出目標"

msgid "Overwrite output"
msgstr "覆寫輸出檔案"

msgid "Quiet"
msgstr "靜默"

msgid "Raw ffmpeg options appended right before the output target."
msgstr "附加在輸出目標之前的原始 ffmpeg 參數。"

msgid "Scale"
msgstr "解析度"

msgid "Start on boot"
msgstr "開機自動啟動"

msgid "Task name"
msgstr "任務名稱"

msgid "Tasks"
msgstr "任務"

msgid "Verbose"
msgstr "詳細"

msgid "Video bitrate"
msgstr "視訊位元率"

msgid "Video codec"
msgstr "視訊編碼"

msgid "Warning"
msgstr "警告"

msgid "Absolute path of the ffmpeg executable."
msgstr "ffmpeg 執行檔的絕對路徑。"

msgid "Each task is started from this directory."
msgstr "每個任務都在此目錄下啟動。"

msgid "Enable FFmpeg management"
msgstr "啟用 FFmpeg 管理"

msgid "FFmpeg Settings"
msgstr "FFmpeg 設定"

msgid "FFmpeg binary"
msgstr "FFmpeg 執行檔"

msgid "Global settings"
msgstr "全域設定"

msgid "Global settings shared by every task."
msgstr "所有任務共用的全域設定。"

msgid "Log directory"
msgstr "日誌目錄"

msgid "One <section>.log file is written per task."
msgstr "每個任務對應一個 <section>.log 日誌檔。"

msgid "When disabled, no task is started on boot."
msgstr "關閉後，開機時不會啟動任何任務。"

msgid "Working directory"
msgstr "工作目錄"

msgid "FFmpeg"
msgstr "FFmpeg"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"
